# signaloverdrive.net's Cloudflare Pages headers. substratic's stage-web copies
# this to the root of the deploy tree; its checks/serve-site.mjs applies the
# same rules locally, so check-site and the preview see what Pages sends.
#
# The game under /drive/ is cross-origin isolated (COOP + COEP + CORP): the
# audio bridge needs SharedArrayBuffer for its AudioWorklet ring, and without
# isolation it falls back to the ScriptProcessor path, which hitches. The
# landing is NOT isolated: it has no need, and an isolated page would refuse
# any embed that does not opt in. scripts/check-site-arm.mjs holds both.
#
# The game's path is the mount: in substratic.sgv. Change both together; the
# arm refuses a tree whose game path is not isolated here.
#
# _headers does NOT reach a Pages Function's response, so the wasm's Function
# (functions/w/[[path]].js, generated by stage-web) sets its own CORP and COEP.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/drive/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
